#
# Income Tax Information Bulletin #3 (March 2023), Payment of Indiana
# Estimated Tax by Individuals, which the 2026 Form ES-40 refers filers to:
# how withholding counts toward the installments, how a late payment and an
# overpayment are applied, and the January 31 filing that excuses the fourth
# installment. The anchors are its own headings; no page is given, as the
# copy has not been paged.

